<html lang='pt-br'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Início</title>
    <link rel='preconnect' href='https://fonts.googleapis.com' />
    <link
      href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap'
      rel='stylesheet'
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-deep: #0a0e1a;
        --panel: #121729;
        --panel-border: #232b45;
        --panel-raised: #161d33;
        --text-main: #e8ecf4;
        --text-muted: #7a85a3;
        --text-dim: #4a5170;
        --accent-a: #4fd1c5;
        --accent-b: #9f7aea;
        --danger: #f0708a;
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: var(--bg-deep);
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        color: var(--text-main);
        min-height: 100%;
      }
      body {
        position: relative;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }
      .stars {
        content: '';
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background-image:
          radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 20px 30px, #ffffff40, transparent),
          radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 140px 90px, #ffffff30, transparent),
          radial-gradient(1px 1px at 90px 160px, #ffffff28, transparent),
          radial-gradient(2px 2px at 220px 60px, #ffffff35, transparent),
          radial-gradient(1px 1px at 260px 200px, #ffffff22, transparent),
          radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 320px 140px, #ffffff30, transparent),
          radial-gradient(1px 1px at 40px 220px, #ffffff22, transparent),
          radial-gradient(2px 2px at 380px 30px, #ffffff30, transparent);
        background-repeat: repeat;
        background-size: 400px 260px;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        animation: drift 220s linear infinite;
        opacity: 0.6;
      }
      @keyframes drift {
        from {
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
        to {
          transform: translateY(-1000px);
        }
      }

      .center-wrap {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 40px;
      }

      .hero {
        max-width: 560px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }
      .brand-mark {
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        border-radius: 7px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-a), var(--accent-b));
      }
      .brand-name {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 36px;
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }

      p.lead {
        font-size: 13.5px;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0 0 32px;
      }

      .panel {
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 28px;
        position: relative;
      }
      .panel::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: -1px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 1px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-a), var(--accent-b));
        -webkit-mask:
          linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box,
          linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
        -webkit-mask-composite: xor;
        mask-composite: exclude;
        opacity: 0.18;
        animation: breathe 5s ease-in-out infinite;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      @keyframes breathe {
        0%,
        100% {
          opacity: 0.1;
        }
        50% {
          opacity: 0.3;
        }
      }

      .panel-title {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .panel-sub {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--text-dim);
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 11px 22px;
        border-radius: 9px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-a), var(--accent-b));
        color: var(--bg-deep);
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        text-decoration: none;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
      }
      .btn:hover {
        opacity: 0.85;
      }

      .status-line {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: 24px;
        font-size: 11px;
        color: var(--text-dim);
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }
      .pulse-dot {
        width: 7px;
        height: 7px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--accent-a);
        animation: pulse 2.2s ease-out infinite;
      }
      @keyframes pulse {
        0% {
          box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(79, 209, 197, 0.5);
        }
        70% {
          box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(79, 209, 197, 0);
        }
        100% {
          box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(79, 209, 197, 0);
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='stars'></div>

    <div class='center-wrap'>
      <div class='hero'>
        <div class='brand'>
          <div class='brand-mark'></div>
          <div class='brand-name'>Painel</div>
        </div>

        <div class='eyebrow'>Bem-vindo</div>
        <h1>Sua central de acesso</h1>
        <p class='lead'>
          Acompanhe o sistema e acesse as áreas restritas da plataforma a partir daqui.
        </p>

        <div class='panel'>
          <div class='panel-title'>Área de usuários</div>
          <div class='panel-sub'>Acesso restrito — requer autenticação</div>
          <a href='/private/profile' class='btn'>Ver usuários →</a>
        </div>

        <div class='status-line'>
          <span class='pulse-dot'></span>Sistema operacional
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
